{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"magi_sanctum","model_identifier":"magi_sanctum","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# magi_sanctum\n\nMagi Sanctum: a round stone tower with a tall pointed slate roof, tall arched windows that glow faintly violet, carved runes around the door and a glowing crystal on the peak that turns slowly.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 8 columns (128 x 128 units, 3.60 x 3.60 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -37..37, y 0..276, z -37..37 units.\n- Texture: 512 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 84, construction_0 19, construction_33 43, construction_66 58, ruined 22 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- tower: 72 x 276 x 72 centred at the origin (or 72 x 156 x 72 plus a 40 x 120 x 40 spire box)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `magi_sanctum_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `magi_sanctum_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_magi_sanctum` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 6.0 | loop | `crystal` on the peak turns slowly (one turn per 6 s) and bobs 2 u. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -41)\n- `slot_balcony` at (0, 156, -38)\n- `fx_magic` at (0, 262, 0)\n"},"resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-36.0,0.0,-36.0],"to":[36.0,4.0,36.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[107.0,412.0,179.0,416.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[107.0,412.0,179.0,416.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[107.0,412.0,179.0,416.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[107.0,412.0,179.0,416.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[222.0,0.0,294.0,72.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[222.0,0.0,294.0,72.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4da8c3cb-150b-5b79-bd94-5b0d3a063c8f"},{"name":"tower_a","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-32.0,4.0,-13.44],"to":[32.0,150.0,13.44],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[7.0,0.0,71.0,146.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[121.56,0.0,148.44,146.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[7.0,0.0,71.0,146.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[121.56,0.0,148.44,146.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[404.0,318.56,468.0,345.44],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[404.0,318.56,468.0,345.44],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0fa7524c-d310-55b9-984a-99a1788bcabb"},{"name":"tower_b","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-13.44,4.0,-32.0],"to":[13.44,150.0,32.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[121.56,0.0,148.44,146.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[7.0,0.0,71.0,146.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[121.56,0.0,148.44,146